      <small>ADP RUN Legacy Benchmark [Quote-Only · Modeled]</small>
      <strong class="calc-big" id="ptc-adp-yr">$4,685/yr</strong>
      <span class="calc-sub" id="ptc-adp-sub">Incl. $32/extra state + $7.50/form W-2 fee</span>
