    <p style="margin:.2rem 0 0;font-size:.86rem;color:#065f46" id="ptc-gov-tax-detail">Based on {{ defW2 }} W-2 employees: $42/emp IRS FUTA (0.6% on $7,000) + $245/emp State SUI + $184,500 OASDI wage base.</p>
