    <p style="margin:.25rem 0 0;font-size:.84rem;color:#1e3a8a">Interconnected VoIP lines incur the <strong>FCC Q4 2026 Universal Service Fund (USF) 37.6% interstate contribution factor</strong> ($2.40–$4.85/seat/mo carrier USF recovery on the 64.9% safe-harbor allocation) + <strong>FCC Ray Baum's Act &amp; Kari's Law E911 dispatchable-location fees</strong> ($0.95–$3.50/line/mo) + <strong>Regulatory Cost Recovery Fees (RCRF: $3.50–$4.50/line/mo)</strong>. <strong>Oct 28 UCaaS &amp; AI Seat Benchmark:</strong> Cisco Webex ($12 Meet / $22.50 Suite + $0 AI), Microsoft Teams ($4–$6 Base + $15 Phone + $10 Teams Premium / $30 M365 Copilot + 20% NCE monthly penalty), Zoom Workplace ($13.33 Pro / $22.49 Business Plus + $0 AI Companion), Google Workspace ($7–$22 + $10–$30 Voice), RingCentral ($20–$35), Nextiva ($15–$25), Dialpad ($15–$25), 8x8, Aircall ($30/seat, 3-seat min), OpenPhone/Quo ($15–$23), and Grasshopper.</p>
